  "derivation": "Pin-only fixture (rulings P8-R1, P8-R1c): the CP-1 T4.14 period register of the shifted pack, for the contexts behind expected.json#period_basis/USD (submissions.json#contexts/R1, fy-2026, USD) and #period_basis/EUR (#contexts/R2, q4-2026, EUR). No CP-1 promotion was run. Rows come from the frozen `periods` list of cases/financial/manifest.json (the period scopes the CP-1 source context is built from) under the four mapping rules: ids opening-2025, q1-2026..q4-2026, fy-2026. Every row has the 15 T4.14 columns in schema order (model_interface.py:33-42) and every cell is {text, status} as _Tables.row emits it (model_interface.py:254-277): a known value is its text (dates ISO, fiscal_year/fiscal_quarter/day_count decimal text); a None value is text null with status `missing` (:254-255, :259-263), except a column named in the row's references, which is `not_applicable` (:256-258; references = component_period_ids always and fiscal_quarter when period_type is not QUARTER, :339-344). So fiscal_quarter is '1'..'4' on QUARTER rows and null/not_applicable on opening-2025 and fy-2026; the opening row's start_date and day_count are null/missing (a point in time, frozen start null); component_period_ids is null/not_applicable on every row (the frozen register lists none). audit_status 'unaudited' is the CP-1 promotion literal (tests/test_financial_workflow.py:443); source_id 'financial' and source_locator 'page:1' come from the period's first citation (same file :69, 444; model_interface.py:214-223). currency is the run currency read from the pack's 'Currency: <ccy>; amounts in millions' clause (page:1); unit MILLIONS, accounting_basis IFRS, entity_perimeter consolidated group (page:2-4 headers). Day counts 90/91/92/92/365 and end dates are checked against the shifted statements (page:1, page:4).",
